genrei is kind of neat, but really, it's probably more of a hindrance to
learning that a help. If you want to use that parsing facilities, it's a
far better idea to use camxes ( http://camxes.lojban.org ). Using the
glosser is just plain bad IMVHO.

So as far as anyone is really concerned, this is a non-problem.

